OPEN SHIFT COMMANDS:-

1. Login & Cluster Information
oc login https://api.cluster.example.com:6443
oc whoami
oc whoami --show-token
oc status
oc version
oc cluster-info


2. Projects (Namespaces)
oc projects                 # List projects
oc project myproject        # Switch project
oc new-project myproject    # Create new project
oc delete project myproject # Delete project


3. Resources
oc get pods
oc get deployments
oc get services
oc get routes
oc get nodes
oc get pvc
oc get pv
oc get all

4. Describe Resources
oc describe pod <pod-name>
oc describe deployment <deployment-name>
oc describe node <node-name>

5. Create Resources
oc create deployment nginx --image=nginx
oc expose deployment nginx --port=80
oc create service clusterip nginx --tcp=80:80

6. Apply & Delete YAML
oc apply -f deployment.yaml
oc create -f deployment.yaml
oc delete -f deployment.yaml


7. Pods
oc get pods
oc logs <pod-name>
oc logs -f <pod-name>
oc exec -it <pod-name> -- /bin/bash
oc delete pod <pod-name>


8. Scaling
oc scale deployment nginx --replicas=3


9. Rollout
oc rollout status deployment/nginx
oc rollout history deployment/nginx
oc rollout undo deployment/nginx
oc rollout restart deployment/nginx


10. Image Commands
oc import-image
oc tag
oc image info <image-name>



11. Routes
oc expose svc nginx
oc get routes


12. ConfigMaps & Secrets
oc create configmap myconfig --from-file=config.txt
oc create secret generic mysecret --from-literal=password=RedHat123
oc get configmaps
oc get secrets


13. Storage
oc get pv
oc get pvc
oc describe pvc <pvc-name>


14. User & RBAC
oc adm policy add-role-to-user admin user1
oc adm policy add-cluster-role-to-user cluster-admin user1
oc adm policy remove-role-from-user admin user1


15. Node Management
oc get nodes
oc describe node <node-name>
oc adm cordon <node-name>
oc adm uncordon <node-name>
oc adm drain <node-name> --ignore-daemonsets


16. Debugging
oc debug node/<node-name>
oc debug pod/<pod-name>


17. Events
oc get events
oc get events --sort-by=.metadata.creationTimestamp


18. Resource Usage
oc adm top nodes
oc adm top pods


19. Export YAML
oc get deployment nginx -o yaml
oc get pod <pod-name> -o yaml


20. Delete Resources
oc delete pod <pod-name>
oc delete deployment nginx
oc delete service nginx
oc delete route nginx



Useful Shortcuts
oc get po      # Pods
oc get svc     # Services
oc get deploy  # Deployments
oc get rs      # ReplicaSets
oc get dc      # DeploymentConfigs
oc get ns      # Namespaces
oc get all     # All resources


Check Your Current Context
oc whoami
oc project
oc config get-contexts
oc config current-context
